{"name":"Medallion","hex":"#c3a679","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"medallion","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A large medal, usually decorative.","A cut of meat resembling a large medal."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To mark with, or as with, a medallion or medallions."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/medallion"}],"entries":[{"title":"Medallion (architecture)","blocks":[{"text":"A medallion is a round or oval ornament that frames a sculptural or pictorial decoration in any context, but typically a façade, an interior, a monument, or a piece of furniture or equipment."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Arco-di-augusto-rimini-02.jpg/330px-Arco-di-augusto-rimini-02.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medallion_(architecture)","wikidata":"Q115488"},{"title":"Medallion (The Secret Circle)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Medallion\" is the 13th episode of the first season of the CW television series The Secret Circle, and the series' 13th episode overall. It was aired on February 2, 2012. The episode was written by Andrew Miller & Andrea Newman and it was directed by Liz Friedlander."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/22/Medallion_%28The_Secret_Circle%29.jpg/330px-Medallion_%28The_Secret_Circle%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medallion_(The_Secret_Circle)","wikidata":"Q16746167"},{"title":"Medal","blocks":[{"text":"A medal or medallion is a small portable artistic object, a thin disc, normally of metal, carrying a design, usually on both sides. They often have a commemorative purpose, and many are presented as awards. They may be intended to be worn, suspended from clothing or jewellery, although this has not always been the case. They may be struck by dies, as most coins are, or die-cast in a mould."}],"image"